    {
      "key": "lead",
      "type": "lead",
      "title": "ABOUT",
      "text": "**synthwerk-sdk** holds the `@synthwerk/*` npm packages. Studio, widgets and SDK apps import them. The first package is the design tokens. The rest is a plan. The plan is detailed."
    },
    {
      "key": "what",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHAT IT DOES",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "One pnpm workspace",
          "text": "For the `@synthwerk/*` packages: SDK, framework adapters and design packages. TypeScript."
        },
        {
          "lead": "@synthwerk/tokens",
          "text": "The public look (D-41) as CSS variables, a Tailwind 4 theme, JSON and typed exports."
        },
        {
          "lead": "No service at build time",
          "text": "Run `pnpm install && pnpm check`. The repo calls no service at build time."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Tokens work",
          "text": "The SDK, the adapters and the UI packages do not exist yet. Nothing is on npm yet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "demo",
      "type": "commands",
      "title": "TOKENS DEMO AND SCREENSHOTS",
      "rows": [
        {
          "cmd": "pnpm --filter @synthwerk/tokens demo",
          "text": "Demo page on `http://127.0.0.1:4173/demo/`."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "pnpm --filter @synthwerk/tokens screenshots",
          "text": "Theme checks in Chromium + PNGs in `./screenshots`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "import",
      "type": "terminal",
      "title": "IN AN APP, IMPORT THE CSS AFTER TAILWIND",
      "lines": [
        "@import \"tailwindcss\";",
        "@import \"@synthwerk/tokens/tokens.css\";",
        "@import \"@synthwerk/tokens/tailwind.css\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "outputs",
      "type": "commands",
      "title": "ONE SOURCE, THREE FILES, TWO THEMES",
      "rows": [
        {
          "cmd": "src/tokens.ts",
          "text": "One source in four layers: primitive > semantic > component > service."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "tokens.css",
          "text": "CSS vars."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "tailwind.css",
          "text": "Tailwind map."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "tokens.json",
          "text": "Hex values."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "consumers",
          "text": "Studio, widgets and SDK apps read all three."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "themes",
          "text": "**default** (website + dashboard look) and **contrast** (AAA)."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "modes",
          "text": "**light**, **dark** and **system**. Default: follow the OS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "packages",
      "type": "commands",
      "title": "PACKAGES, CONFIGURATION, API",
      "rows": [
        {
          "cmd": "@synthwerk/tokens",
          "text": "In `packages/tokens`. Exports `.` (typed data, `resolveMode`, `contrastRatio`, `firstPaintScript`), `./tokens.css`, `./tailwind.css`, `./tokens.json`, `./assets/*`. **0.2.0, not published.**"
        },
        {
          "cmd": "configuration",
          "text": "None. The repo ships npm packages, not a running service."
        },
        {
          "cmd": "API and events",
          "text": "No HTTP API and no events. Service APIs live in [synthwerk-contracts](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk-contracts)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dev",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "DEVELOPMENT",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Lint and format",
          "text": "Biome 2.5 (D-06). Run `pnpm format` before a commit."
        },
        {
          "lead": "TypeScript 6.0.3 for now",
          "text": "The SDK core moves to TS 7 when it starts."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Node 24",
          "text": "Runs the `.ts` scripts directly (type stripping). No `tsx` needed."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Unit tests",
          "text": "Live in `tests/unit/`. Run `pnpm test`."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Blueprint",
          "text": "Shared CI and templates: [synthwerk-blueprint](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk-blueprint)."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Reference",
          "text": "The full layout, fonts, logo and roadmap are in `docs/REFERENCE.md`."
        }
      ]
    },
